Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you need{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:08.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, don't go off on your own like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:18.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:22.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, get me the green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:44.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous if you don't hold on to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.44,0:00:48.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll{\i0} be in danger?{Me, in danger?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:47.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are there always this many parents shopping with their children?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:49.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That looks nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.15,0:02:55.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.07,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:57.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:00.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, it's not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What size do you wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Turn around, Rin. {Literal: Let me look at your back}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:13.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:17.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where exactly do I measure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know~! {Wonder if "I don't know" will be better}{"No idea" is a more adult thing to say, going with I don't know for her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:19.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop flapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:21.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What other clothes do you need? {What else do you need}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:26.10,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pyjamas, underwear, shirts, socks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:36.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you buying any skirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:38.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All you have are pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:41.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Skirts aren't allowed in daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:54.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot... tomorrow is Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:01.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Daikichi, I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there, so hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:09.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.01,0:04:12.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:18.82,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Skipping classes again? {Was thinking of doing this, as it's background chatter. AC, Avid, please see if it's okay, otherwise will change it back. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.86,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}You're slacking again, you lazybones. {Think of something you would call someone who is lazy} {"Lazybones" should work. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:24.32,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Always bringing back useless stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.12,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}I will get angry, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:28.70,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}What did you say, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.17,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.00,Default-Alt,TV,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.59,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:40.30,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is the Maeda family. {Maeda, speaking}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:44.97,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,It was so sudden; my condolences for your loss. {i'm sorry for your lost}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.97,0:04:47.55,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:51.22,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, it's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:54.48,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Coming, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:59.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, excuse me; I didn't know your cellphone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:00.94,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:04.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, what do you need to enrol in a daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:06.70,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.33,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? You really brought Rin-chan home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.29,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, are you sure it's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,At the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:22.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, I can't afford to take any more leave from work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's the procedure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:27.55,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,About that, you don't get in that quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:31.18,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you ask that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:34.52,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, you should ask at the city offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's a Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:38.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:40.52,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, just something happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.15,0:05:41.94,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Mama, is that Rin-chan? Is that Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:44.74,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Reina! I'm discussing something important here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.19,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right? {Added, please rephrase if necessary. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:44.74,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:47.78,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There is a temporary emergency daycare. {Or nursery}{緊急一時 保育 kinkyuu ichiji hoiku}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary emergency daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:50.32,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:52.08,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! {Split. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.29,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.20,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:56.83,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan! {Augh, please shut up... -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing, something minor over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.25,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be done shortly, so wait first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.50,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina can't wait any longer. {Use "I" is also acceptable}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.84,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, I'm turning off the burner for your miso soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.55,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:07.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you sound really busy. Later I'll{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.22,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,RIN-CHAN! {Ouch. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:16.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, there's not many.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:19.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The time I need to get to work is doubled, all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:21.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. {Oh nice, they made Reina sound like a squirrel chattering. Or was it a chipmunk? -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:24.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:28.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This one may be nearby, but it's impossible for me to get off work by six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.57,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Let's play again next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.57,0:06:32.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, bye bye Reina-chan. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This one doesn't look too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:40.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary Emergency Daycare can only be up to 10 days, at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:42.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:46.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:09.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, Daikichi, it's morning~!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.74,0:07:13.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:22.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You were sleeping over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.59,0:07:26.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The futon is strangely warm, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:30.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:34.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:41.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be going to the daycare today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.32,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:56.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't put your elbows on the table while eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I apologise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:09.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen carefully, the daycare we're heading to now is only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:13.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Means you'll be going to this one before an official one has been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:16.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What does "official" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:25.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It means the proper one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, actually that's incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:31.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My hair is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:37.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:40.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:53.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,N-No problem. {Hang in there :) -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:00.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:04.35,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let me down, let me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:07.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:10.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You get embarrassed when the other kids see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:24.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.79,0:09:32.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving her in your care. {I'm counting on you}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.26,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make that kind of face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:04.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to get you until dark, but I'll rush here as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:18.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky promise, if you tell a lie, you will swallow a thousand needles...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:22.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,...God damn it! It's a promise! {lol -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The words are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be going. Wait for me, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My bad, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:39.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to be considerate of your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:44.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Whether it's about your mother, or Grandpa's death. {寿命 = life span, but he means death anyway}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:48.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,None of these things are easy to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:52.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,900)}The lonely reality of being left all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:56.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,800)}You must also be thinking {\i1}I'll{\i0} abandon you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't do something like this a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:14.77,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:39.59,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:42.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm eating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm rushing so that I can leave early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.05,0:11:46.10,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.35,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be going then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:50.85,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Trying so hard even at the start of the month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:09.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Please take a picture of this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:09.98,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.08,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:14.00,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Someone is asking for you on outside line #4 about the internal exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:19.30,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for waiting, Kawachi speaking.{"Changing hands now" sounds too awkward}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.51,0:12:30.93,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,250)}Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:32.52,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,300)}Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.73,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Let's continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.73,0:12:38.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.28,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:50.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.63,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.04,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. {He says "Sorry" twice, right? -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:59.09,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Get your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:00.46,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:08.10,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:08.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:10.51,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:28.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, a moment please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:32.54,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata-san from Mitsumoto Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Transfer it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.50,0:13:40.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kawachi, sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:56.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:05.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'll be leaving the office in a short while. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:48.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The daycare!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:04.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.63,0:15:12.09,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:15.31,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:17.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:29.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, french fries? They look delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kinpira! {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kinpira}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.32,Note,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Note: Kinpira is a method of cooking by simmering root vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:44.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Swallow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,...a thousand needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:22.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving all these to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, you've to sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:04.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Worrying about it is needless, but what happens if I really find a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:17.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:18.80,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:22.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:27.15,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, this should have been sent yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm extremely sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:34.15,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Coming from you, that's rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.82,0:17:38.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I've already apologised to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:40.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that, I'll contact them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.04,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while; let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I can't make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:51.55,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.55,0:17:53.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have some things tomorrow, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:17:57.88,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:01.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:22.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:26.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:40.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:44.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Charge! {Redundant}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:01.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, don't let the moon catch us! {Lit: Get away from the moon}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:05.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right~!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:45.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How long can I sustain this kind of lifestyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.50,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1800)}All these belong to Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:20:01.47,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Even though there's only so few of them, the MCH Handbook and other important documents are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.34,0:20:08.39,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Raising a child is very difficult, even if it's on a short term.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:11.52,Default,Uncle,0000,0000,0000,,All this is hardest on Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:16.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about it; I'm taking a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:23.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The mouth hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:31.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Our relatives are describing you like some sort of a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:36.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Though really, who's the real devil here, Masako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.10,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.98,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:21.19,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, which side are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.91,0:22:31.53,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is that m-mine!? {Wow. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.95,0:22:36.00,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,That's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:47.22,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, right, sweat it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.22,0:22:49.34,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to remove the sheets, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:51.34,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,I told you that's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:54.01,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,That's also what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.04,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,ashita no koto ha wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.04,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,明日のことは　分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.04,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:06.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,korette gisei toha chigau nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:06.17,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,これって　犠牲とは違う　何かが違う
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:06.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,This is different from sacrificing, very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:09.88,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,batsugeemu jaa nante omou wa nai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:09.88,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,罰ゲームじゃあ　なんて思うわない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:09.88,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think this is a punishment game either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:13.05,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,tte nande nanoka ha wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:13.05,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,って　なんでなのかは　分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:13.05,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really say well what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:16.30,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:16.30,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,ちょっと　釈然としないけど　
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.05,0:01:16.30,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, I do feel quite troubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:22.47,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nantemonjanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:22.47,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,キミの存在　今大事だ　なんてもんじゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:22.47,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,but "important" cannot be used to describe your existence any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:28.60,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,owaranai koto nante konoyo no dokonimonai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:28.60,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,終わらないことなんて　この世のどこにもない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:28.60,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing that will last forever without coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:32.82,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,naku no ha tsurai janai no
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:32.82,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,泣くのは辛いじゃないの　
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:32.82,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Crying is a very painful thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.44,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! Sweet drops! Sweet drops!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:38.95,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,zutto yume mite itaine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:38.95,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,ずっと　夢見ていたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:38.95,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I have always wanted to dream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:42.24,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,motto yasashiku shitaine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:42.24,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もっと　優しくしたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:42.24,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,To be able to be more gentle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.79,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kimi to iraretara happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.79,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,キミと居られたら　happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.79,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being together with you is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,onnanoko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.21,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,女の子って　強いね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:49.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:52.50,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,dakedo tokitoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:52.50,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,だけど　ときとき　弱いね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:52.50,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,but at times, they are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:59.09,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,bokura no negai ha happy! happy! happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:59.09,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,僕らの願いは　happy! happy! happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:59.09,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Our wish is to be happy! Happy! Happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:03.06,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,sonna hibi mo happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:03.06,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,そんな日々も happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:03.06,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Such happy days!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:10.31,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,Just wanna make you happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:48.85,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,nichiyou no hare ta hiru sagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:48.85,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,日曜の晴れた昼さがり
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:48.85,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,On a clear Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:52.14,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,kyou ha doko he yukou
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:52.14,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,今日はどこへ行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:52.14,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we heading today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:21:03.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:21:03.57,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}通い慣れたいつもの道が眩しく輝いて見える
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:21:03.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}The usual road that we always take seems to be shining radiantly
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:13.54,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,terasu atatakai taiyou to tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:13.54,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,照らす暖かい太陽と　隣に君がいれば　
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:13.54,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,The warm sun shining with you still by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:18.08,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:18.08,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もう　High　High　High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:18.08,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,We're already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:23.84,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:23.84,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,はしゃぎだす気持ちに
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:23.84,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Feeling merry
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:28.76,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:28.76,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,歌え　Life　Life　Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:28.76,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing life, life, life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:34.14,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,koe ha dokomade mo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:34.14,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,声はどこまでも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:34.14,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,I can hear our voices anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:39.19,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:39.19,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,もう　High　High　High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:39.19,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,We're already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:44.69,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:44.69,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,舞い上がる風に乗り
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:44.69,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Riding on the soaring wind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:49.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:49.57,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,歌え　Life　Life　Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.69,0:21:49.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Sing life, life, life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:58.17,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:58.17,ED Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,声も飛び跳ねる
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:58.17,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,Our voices are hopping too
